{"seq":2,"slug":"inverter-based-resources-and-stability","title":"逆变器电源与电网稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/inverter-based-resources-and-stability","wordCount":2357,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"逆变器电源与电网稳定性\">逆变器电源与电网稳定性</h1><p>2025 年 4 月 28 日,西班牙和葡萄牙在十几秒内丢掉了整张电网。ENTSO-E 专家组 2026 年 3 月发布的最终报告把原因钉在了一连串相互作用的因素上:崩溃前出现两段振荡——一段是变流器电源强迫产生的 0.63 Hz 振荡,一段是 0.2 Hz 的天然区域间振荡——叠加上电压控制失灵,导致电压快速抬升、发电机级联脱网(<a href=\"https://www.entsoe.eu/news/2026/03/20/entso-e-publishes-expert-panel-final-report-on-28-april-2025-blackout-in-spain-and-portugal/\">ENTSO-E 28 April 2025 Blackout</a>)。报告里最关键的一句来自 ENTSO-E 董事会主席 Damián Cortinas:&quot;问题不在可再生能源,而在电压控制,与发电类型无关。&quot;这句话精确划定了本文的主题:当同步发电机退场、电力电子接口的电源(IBR)成为主力,电网的稳定机制本身被重写了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传统电网的稳定性建立在同步发电机的物理特性上:旋转质量提供惯量,电磁同步力把所有机组拉到同一个频率,短路时机端能瞬间灌出 5-7 倍额定电流支撑电压。逆变器电源(Inverter-Based Resources,IBR——光伏、风机、电池储能)没有旋转质量,输出电流受半导体器件热极限硬性限制(通常仅 1.1-1.5 倍额定),它的&quot;行为&quot;完全由控制算法定义。这就把稳定性问题从物理特性问题变成了控制工程问题。</p>\n<p>IBR 按控制范式分两类。<strong>跟网型(Grid-Following,GFL)</strong> 用锁相环(PLL)测量电网电压相位,再把自己的电流注入对齐过去——它假设电网电压是给定的、稳定的,自己只当一个受控电流源。<strong>构网型(Grid-Forming,GFM)</strong> 反过来,内部维持一个电压相量,主动&quot;建立&quot;电压幅值与相位,表现得像一个电压源,因此能在弱电网甚至无同步机的孤岛里自主定义频率与电压。GFM 对扰动的响应几乎是瞬时的,典型在 0-5 个工频周期内完成(<a href=\"https://www.nerc.com/globalassets/who-we-are/standing-committees/rstc/irps/webinar_1.pdf\">NERC IBR 资料</a>)。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>同步发电机</th>\n<th>跟网型 IBR(GFL)</th>\n<th>构网型 IBR(GFM)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电气模型</td>\n<td>电压源(物理)</td>\n<td>受控电流源</td>\n<td>电压源(控制构造)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惯量</td>\n<td>真实旋转惯量</td>\n<td>无(可加快频响)</td>\n<td>合成惯量 / 类惯量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步机制</td>\n<td>电磁同步力</td>\n<td>锁相环(PLL)</td>\n<td>内部功角控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障电流</td>\n<td>5-7 倍额定</td>\n<td>~1.1 倍,受限</td>\n<td>1.1-1.5 倍,可短时构压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱电网表现</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>SCR 低时易失稳</td>\n<td>可在弱网/孤岛运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黑启动能力</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[电网扰动&lt;br/&gt;电压跌落与频率偏移] --&gt; B{IBR 控制范式}&#10;    B --&gt;|跟网型 GFL| C[PLL 测相位]&#10;    C --&gt; D[按指令注入电流&lt;br/&gt;依赖外部电压参考]&#10;    D --&gt; E[弱电网下 PLL 失锁&lt;br/&gt;引发振荡]&#10;    B --&gt;|构网型 GFM| F[内部电压相量&lt;br/&gt;主动构建电压]&#10;    F --&gt; G[瞬时输出有功/无功&lt;br/&gt;提供合成惯量]&#10;    G --&gt; H[支撑频率与电压&lt;br/&gt;可孤岛运行]&#10;    E --&gt; I[系统强度不足&lt;br/&gt;级联脱网风险]&#10;    H --&gt; J[提升系统强度&lt;br/&gt;稳定运行]\">flowchart TD\n    A[电网扰动&lt;br/&gt;电压跌落与频率偏移] --&gt; B{IBR 控制范式}\n    B --&gt;|跟网型 GFL| C[PLL 测相位]\n    C --&gt; D[按指令注入电流&lt;br/&gt;依赖外部电压参考]\n    D --&gt; E[弱电网下 PLL 失锁&lt;br/&gt;引发振荡]\n    B --&gt;|构网型 GFM| F[内部电压相量&lt;br/&gt;主动构建电压]\n    F --&gt; G[瞬时输出有功/无功&lt;br/&gt;提供合成惯量]\n    G --&gt; H[支撑频率与电压&lt;br/&gt;可孤岛运行]\n    E --&gt; I[系统强度不足&lt;br/&gt;级联脱网风险]\n    H --&gt; J[提升系统强度&lt;br/&gt;稳定运行]</pre><h2 id=\"系统强度与短路比-弱电网为什么会失稳\">系统强度与短路比:弱电网为什么会失稳</h2><p>工程上衡量一个并网点&quot;扛扰动&quot;能力的核心指标是<strong>系统强度</strong>,用短路比(Short-Circuit Ratio,SCR)量化——并网点的短路容量与接入电源额定容量之比:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SCR} = \\frac{S_{sc}}{P_{rated}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SCR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{sc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该点的短路容量(MVA),<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{rated}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是接入 IBR 的额定容量(MW)。SCR 越高,说明并网点电压越&quot;硬&quot;——注入或抽取功率时电压几乎不动。传统经验里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SCR} &gt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SCR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 算强电网,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SCR} &lt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SCR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 就进入弱电网区,跟网型 IBR 在低 SCR 下会出现 PLL 失锁、控制环交互、次同步振荡等问题。</p>\n<p>为什么同步机退场会拉低系统强度?因为短路容量主要由附近同步机贡献:同步机能瞬间灌出数倍额定的短路电流,把故障点电压&quot;撑&quot;住;而 GFL 型 IBR 几乎不提供短路电流。于是当一个区域光伏渗透率攀升、本地火电/水电关停,SCR 持续下降,原本稳定运行的 IBR 群会因为&quot;脚下的地&quot;变软而集体失稳。这正是伊比利亚事件里&quot;动态薄弱&quot;的物理含义——西班牙、葡萄牙绝大多数可再生电厂装的是跟网型逆变器,无法提供电压崩溃时急需的无功与电压支撑(<a href=\"https://www.pv-tech.org/combination-of-voltage-and-oscillation-caused-iberian-blackout-says-entso-e-report/\">PV-Tech 对 ENTSO-E 报告的解读</a>)。</p>\n<p>补强系统强度有两条路。一是同步调相机(synchronous condenser)——本质是空转的同步电机,只出无功和短路电流,不发有功;二是构网型电池储能,用控制算法模拟电压源行为。澳大利亚 Transgrid 的系统强度计划(2025 年 7 月定稿,评估了三年共 100 多个方案)选的就是组合拳:5 GW 构网型电池储能 + 10 台同步调相机 + 改造 650 MW 现有同步机组,净市场收益约 88 亿澳元(<a href=\"https://www.energy-storage.news/australias-transgrid-shortlists-2gw-of-grid-battery-storage-to-replace-coals-system-strength-in-nsw/\">energy-storage.news</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构网型逆变器的控制内核\">构网型逆变器的控制内核</h2><p>GFM 的关键在于&quot;不依赖外部电压参考也能自己定义频率&quot;。最主流的实现是<strong>虚拟同步机(VSM)/ 下垂控制</strong>,核心是在控制器里复刻同步机的功角方程。下垂控制把有功-频率、无功-电压绑成两条人为设定的斜率:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega = \\omega_0 - m_p (P - P_0), \\qquad V = V_0 - n_q (Q - Q_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是下垂系数,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是空载参考。功率上升,逆变器主动降频降压,与电网其他电源自然分担负荷——和同步机的调速、调压特性如出一辙,因此多台 GFM 与同步机可以无通信地并联同步。</p>\n<p>更进一步的虚拟同步机控制会显式引入虚拟转动惯量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 与阻尼 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>,让逆变器在频率变化时按下式吐出/吸收功率,提供<strong>合成惯量</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>J</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{inertia} = J \\omega_0 \\frac{d\\omega}{dt} + D (\\omega - \\omega_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ia</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但 GFM 有一个绕不开的硬约束:作为电压源,故障瞬间它会试图维持电压,这要求灌出大电流,而半导体器件扛不住。所以 GFM 必须配<strong>故障电流限制</strong>逻辑,在限流的同时尽量保住构压能力——这正是 2024 年后学界热门的&quot;cross-forming control&quot;等方案要解决的核心矛盾(<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2404.13376\">arXiv: Cross-Forming Control and Fault Current Limiting</a>)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[功率/电压测量] --&gt; B[下垂控制&lt;br/&gt;P-f 与 Q-V 斜率]&#10;    B --&gt; C[虚拟同步机环&lt;br/&gt;虚拟惯量 J + 阻尼 D]&#10;    C --&gt; D[内部电压相量&lt;br/&gt;幅值与相角]&#10;    D --&gt; E[电压电流双环调节]&#10;    E --&gt; F{故障检测}&#10;    F --&gt;|正常| G[PWM 调制&lt;br/&gt;输出构网电压]&#10;    F --&gt;|故障| H[故障电流限制&lt;br/&gt;限流但尽量构压]&#10;    H --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; I[并网点电压]\">flowchart TD\n    A[功率/电压测量] --&gt; B[下垂控制&lt;br/&gt;P-f 与 Q-V 斜率]\n    B --&gt; C[虚拟同步机环&lt;br/&gt;虚拟惯量 J + 阻尼 D]\n    C --&gt; D[内部电压相量&lt;br/&gt;幅值与相角]\n    D --&gt; E[电压电流双环调节]\n    E --&gt; F{故障检测}\n    F --&gt;|正常| G[PWM 调制&lt;br/&gt;输出构网电压]\n    F --&gt;|故障| H[故障电流限制&lt;br/&gt;限流但尽量构压]\n    H --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; I[并网点电压]</pre><h2 id=\"标准与合规-ieee-2800-的强制时间线\">标准与合规:IEEE 2800 的强制时间线</h2><p>2026 年对北美 IBR 并网是个分水岭。IEEE Std 2800-2022——首版《IBR 与输电系统互联互操作标准》——确立了 IBR 的最低能力与性能共识,涵盖电压/频率穿越、有功控制、无功控制、异常频率下的动态有功支撑、异常电压下的动态电压支撑等(<a href=\"https://www.energy.gov/cmei/systems/essential-grid-reliability-standards-inverter-based-resources\">美国能源部:Essential Grid Reliability Standards for IBRs</a>)。它从&quot;自愿&quot;转向&quot;强制&quot;的关键节点恰好落在 2026:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>里程碑</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IEEE 2800-2022 发布</td>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td>自愿标准,定义最低性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制(大型 IBR)</td>\n<td>2026-10-01</td>\n<td>&gt;75 MVA 且接入 ≥100 kV 的 IBR 电厂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制(中型 IBR)</td>\n<td>2027-01-01</td>\n<td>&gt;20 MVA 且接入 ≥60 kV 的 IBR 电厂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IEEE 2800.2-2026 发布</td>\n<td>2026 春</td>\n<td>测试与验证程序推荐做法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源:<a href=\"https://ieee-pes.org/trending-tech/inverter-based-resources-standards-in-electric-power-grids/\">IEEE PES: IBR Standards</a>、<a href=\"https://keentelengineering.com/ieee-2800-2022-ibr-compliance-guide\">Keentel Engineering: IEEE 2800 合规指南</a>。</p>\n<p>标准体系还在为构网型铺路。IEEE 针对 2800-2022 的修订(2800a)专门&quot;在兼顾系统可靠性与安全的前提下,降低含构网设备 IBR 的技术准入壁垒&quot;,承认 GFM IBR 能提供类惯量服务(<a href=\"https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/2800a/12386/\">IEEE SA: 2800a</a>)。与此并行的是 UNIFI 联盟发布的《构网型 IBR 规范(第 2 版)》,试图统一各厂商对 GFM 的定义,解决&quot;同叫 GFM、实测响应却五花八门&quot;的乱象(<a href=\"https://docs.nrel.gov/docs/fy24osti/89269.pdf\">NREL: UNIFI Specifications</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从试点到主流-2026-年的部署现实\">从试点到主流:2026 年的部署现实</h2><p>澳大利亚是观察 GFM 规模化最好的窗口。AEMO 把构网型电池储能列为 2026 年的优先事项,视其为高可再生渗透电力系统的运行基石。数据很说明问题:截至 2025 年 12 月,NEM 已有 10 套构网型 BESS 投运,合计约 1070 MW 构网能力;在建管道达 94 个项目(78 个独立电池 + 16 个光储/风储混合)(<a href=\"https://www.energy-storage.news/australias-grid-forming-battery-storage-pipeline-extends-to-nearly-a-hundred-projects-says-aemo/\">energy-storage.news: AEMO 管道</a>)。到 2026 年第一季度,33.2 GW 的 NEM 电池储能管道里有 74% 采用构网型逆变器——GFM 已从试点走向默认选项(<a href=\"https://www.indexbox.io/blog/74-of-australias-battery-storage-pipeline-features-grid-forming-inverters-aemo-reports/\">IndexBox/AEMO Q1 2026 数据</a>)。</p>\n<p>这背后的逻辑链条很直接:燃煤机组退役 → 系统强度(短路容量、惯量)下降 → 必须用别的东西补上。构网型电池储能恰好能一身兼三职——出有功削峰填谷、出无功撑电压、用合成惯量稳频率——而且响应比同步机更快。它正在接替煤电退出后留下的&quot;系统强度&quot;角色(<a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine-australia.com/2026/04/15/grid-forming-inverters-move-mainstream-as-australia-seeks-reliable-battery-ready-infrastructure/\">pv-magazine: GFM 进入主流</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>IBR 取代同步机后,稳定性从物理特性问题变成控制工程问题:没有旋转惯量、故障电流受半导体硬限,行为完全由算法定义。</li>\n<li>跟网型(GFL)靠锁相环跟随电网电压、当受控电流源,弱电网(低 SCR)下易 PLL 失锁、振荡;构网型(GFM)主动构建电压相量、当电压源,可在弱网/孤岛运行并提供合成惯量。</li>\n<li>系统强度用短路比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SCR}=S_{sc}/P_{rated}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SCR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量;同步机退场使短路容量下降,是伊比利亚 2025-04-28 大停电&quot;动态薄弱&quot;的根因之一(ENTSO-E 2026 终报)。</li>\n<li>GFM 控制内核是虚拟同步机/下垂控制(复刻功角方程 + 虚拟惯量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>、阻尼 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>),核心难点是故障期间在限流与构压之间取舍。</li>\n<li>合规层面 IEEE 2800-2022 在 2026-10-01 对 &gt;75 MVA、≥100 kV 的 IBR 强制生效,2027-01-01 扩到中型;2800a 与 UNIFI 规范为 GFM 铺路。</li>\n<li>部署上 GFM 已主流化:2026 Q1 澳洲 33.2 GW 电池储能管道中 74% 采用构网型,接替退役煤电的系统强度角色。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"逆变器电源与电网稳定性","id":"逆变器电源与电网稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"系统强度与短路比:弱电网为什么会失稳","id":"系统强度与短路比-弱电网为什么会失稳"},{"level":2,"text":"构网型逆变器的控制内核","id":"构网型逆变器的控制内核"},{"level":2,"text":"标准与合规:IEEE 2800 的强制时间线","id":"标准与合规-ieee-2800-的强制时间线"},{"level":2,"text":"从试点到主流:2026 年的部署现实","id":"从试点到主流-2026-年的部署现实"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"波动性可再生能源并网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/variable-renewable-integration"},"next":{"title":"功率预测与弃电","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/forecasting-and-curtailment"}}